# AGRO MIRAI — environment variables
#
# Copy to .env for local dev (already gitignored). No real values below —
# this file documents which vars each Module 03 adapter reads and where
# to get them; it is never a source of truth for a secret.

# Path to the Earth Engine service-account JSON key. The key itself lives
# outside the repo (see docs/TOOLING.md) — never commit it, never paste
# its contents here. Required by NDVIAdapter's live path; the cache
# fallback works without it.
EE_SERVICE_ACCOUNT_KEY=/absolute/path/to/ee-service-account.json

# Open-Meteo (weather) and SoilGrids (soil) need no API key — no vars to
# set for those adapters. Listed here so this file stays the single place
# to check "does adapter X need an env var".

# Module 04 — SupabaseDataStore (prod persistence). Project URL and a
# service-role (or anon, depending on RLS posture chosen later) API key
# from the Supabase dashboard / `supabase projects list`. Never commit
# real values — see docs/TOOLING.md for the CLI commands to create/link
# a project and apply migrations/postgres/001_init.sql.
SUPABASE_URL=https://<project-ref>.supabase.co
SUPABASE_KEY=<service-role-or-anon-key>
